0. GENERAL PROVISIONS
Synapse is a free project. It has always been, is, and will remain completely free of charge.

This license applies to all parts of the project:
- In-game mod (.package and .ts4script)
- Bridge application and launcher (ai_bridge.py, launcher.py, .bat files, any .exe files)
- Original presets, system prompts, configuration files, and settings
- Icons, UI design, visual assets, and graphics
- Documentation, texts, and descriptions

Distribution terms are divided into two parts:
- Creative materials (graphics, icons, UI design, texts, original prompts and author's presets, documentation) are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-NoDerivatives 4.0 International License (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/
- Software code (mod, bridge application, launcher, scripts, executable files) is governed by the author's proprietary Source-Available terms set forth below. Creative Commons officially does not recommend its licenses for software; therefore, the code is licensed separately.

The permissions described in Section 1 (specifically regarding translations and user presets) constitute express individual exceptions granted by the author to the NoDerivatives condition of the CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 license and apply strictly within the scope defined in this document.

1. WHAT IS PERMITTED
- Free Redistribution. You may share the original, unmodified mod and bridge application on any websites, forums, and file-hosting services, provided all of the following conditions are met: mandatory attribution to the author (Thistle / ThistleInHeart), indication of the current version number, and a direct active link to the official project repository (https://github.com/ThistleInHeart/Synapse); download access must be strictly free of charge and unmonetized; the archive and all files must be distributed strictly separately (outside of collections and modpacks) and in their original state, without any modifications or repackaging of executable files.
- Translations into Any Language. Full freedom is granted for standalone translation files: early access, subscriptions, donations, and any form of monetization. No royalties to the author are required. Translation files are strictly defined as: a standalone .package file for the game installed on top of the original mod; a standalone .txt / .json localization file for the bridge application. Conditions: the translation must be distributed strictly as a separate file, and the release must not include files of the original mod or bridge; the translator must explicitly state that the translation is unofficial (fan-made) and that the mod author (Thistle) is not affiliated with any fundraising for the localization; translators are solely responsible for complying with the EA Modding Policy.
- Custom Presets and Prompts. Users are permitted to create their own (authored from scratch) character, lore presets, and system prompts for Synapse, share them with the community, or monetize them under any terms. Conditions: they must be distributed strictly as standalone configuration/text files without bundling code, original author presets, or files of the mod or bridge itself; in case of paid distribution, the preset creator must explicitly state that the material is unofficial and that the mod author (Thistle) is not affiliated with any fundraising.
- Integrations and Add-ons. Creation of external scripts and applications that communicate with the mod's API is permitted, provided they contain no Synapse code and are distributed free of charge.
- Streaming, Videos, Reviews, and Guides. Permitted, including on monetized channels and publications, provided proper attribution and a link to the official project repository are included.
- Code Inspection. Studying the project's source code (Source-Available) for educational and informational purposes, as well as for personal security auditing, is permitted.

2. WHAT IS STRICTLY PROHIBITED
- Selling the mod, bridge application, their code, original presets and prompts of the author, any of their parts, assets, or modifications.
- Distributing the mod, bridge, or any forks thereof via paid early access, paid roles, subscriptions, or paywalls (Patreon, Boosty, Ko-fi, private Telegram/Discord channels, and similar platforms). The only exception is strictly standalone translation files and custom presets/prompts created from scratch (Section 1).
- Collecting funds, donations, or tips in the name of the author (Thistle / ThistleInHeart) or under the pretext of funding the development or maintenance of the Synapse project.
- Using mandatory ad-viewing link shorteners or monetized redirects (adf.ly, Linkvertise, and similar services) when publishing links to the mod or official repository.
- Including the mod, bridge application, or any project files in any mod compilations, modpacks, game repacks, or pre-made Mods folders (whether paid or free).
- Claiming authorship, or removing, modifying, or obscuring copyright notices, metadata, version numbers, or credits to the author.
- Publishing modified versions of the mod, bridge, executable files, or assets without the express written consent of the author.
- Using the "Synapse" name, icons, or project branding for third-party projects in a manner that misleads users regarding authorship.
- Reuploading files to platforms where compliance with the above conditions is impossible.

